    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9384aa18-33da-54f3-9d16-a621451c1620" activityNameId="c8cee0e8-aaeb-5d65-b0cf-8641d48cba35" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether, at plant
The process " dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of   dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether rom propylene oxide and methanol in Europe.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure are estimated. Transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 034590-94-8; 
Formula: CH3(OC3H6)2OH; 
Synonyms: DPM, Methoxy propoxy propanol; 
UUID: 820bc761-fa6c-3bc4-8c47-85643f7b7869
Production of dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Etherification of propylene oxide
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure are estimated. Transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_820bc761-fa6c-3bc4-8c47-85643f7b7869.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
